Keep rtflann's private LZ4 symbols out of the shared RTAB-Map API.

The bundled LZ4 1.7.1 has private stream state layouts. Its global C symbols
must not interpose the supported shared LZ4 1.10.0 used by public FLANN/PCL.
Limit visibility to the two C implementation files. Keep the private backend,
its license notices, and the exported C++ RTAB-Map API.

AI-assisted local portability patch. Upstream submission is pending.

--- a/corelib/src/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/corelib/src/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -143,6 +143,14 @@
     opencv/five-point.cpp
 )
 
+# rtflann keeps a private LZ4 ABI. Do not interpose the shared LZ4 provider.
+IF(CMAKE_C_COMPILER_ID MATCHES "GNU|Clang")
+    SET_SOURCE_FILES_PROPERTIES(
+        rtflann/ext/lz4.c rtflann/ext/lz4hc.c
+        PROPERTIES COMPILE_OPTIONS "-fvisibility=hidden"
+    )
+ENDIF()
+
 IF(PCL_VERSION VERSION_GREATER_EQUAL "1.8")
 SET(SRC_FILES
     ${SRC_FILES}
